// ノート読み上げの再生バー。色はテーマの文字色を継承し、面は半透明の
// グレーだけで作る（明暗どちらのテーマでも崩れない）
.root
  position absolute
  &:focus
    outline none
  left 30px
  right 30px
  height 32px
  display flex
  align-items center
  gap 6px
  padding 0 8px
  box-sizing border-box
  border solid 1px rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.35)
  border-radius 3px
  background-color rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.10)
  font-size 12px
  color inherit
  z-index 5

.button
  flex none
  width 26px
  height 24px
  padding 0
  border none
  border-radius 3px
  background transparent
  color inherit
  font-size 12px
  cursor pointer
  &:hover
    background-color rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.25)
  &:disabled
    opacity 0.35
    cursor default
  &:focus
    outline none
  &:focus-visible
    box-shadow inset 0 0 0 2px $ui-active-color

.button--active
  @extend .button
  color $ui-active-color

.button--primary
  @extend .button
  width 30px
  color $ui-active-color

.button--close
  @extend .button
  margin-left auto

// 位置のシークバー。塊の番号が目盛り
.seek
  flex 1 1 60px
  min-width 40px
  max-width 200px
  height 22px
  margin 0 2px
  accent-color $ui-active-color
  background transparent
  &:disabled
    opacity 0.35

.progress
  flex none
  min-width 48px
  text-align center
  font-variant-numeric tabular-nums
  opacity 0.85

.label
  flex 0 1 auto
  max-width 180px
  overflow hidden
  text-overflow ellipsis
  white-space nowrap
  opacity 0.7

.control
  flex none
  display flex
  align-items center
  gap 4px
  margin-left 6px

.control-name
  opacity 0.7

.select
  height 22px
  padding 0 4px
  border solid 1px rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.35)
  border-radius 3px
  background transparent
  color inherit
  font-size 12px
  font-family inherit

.range
  width 80px
  height 22px
  margin 0
  accent-color $ui-active-color
  background transparent

.error
  flex 1 1 auto
  min-width 0
  overflow hidden
  text-overflow ellipsis
  white-space nowrap
  color #E06060

// キー案内。バーの直下に重ねる半透明のパネル（グラスモーフィズム）
.help
  position absolute
  top 36px
  right 0
  z-index 20
  min-width 360px
  max-width 520px
  padding 10px 12px
  border solid 1px rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.35)
  border-radius 6px
  background-color rgba(40, 40, 44, 0.85)
  backdrop-filter blur(12px)
  -webkit-backdrop-filter blur(12px)
  color #eee
  font-size 12px
  line-height 1.5
  box-shadow 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35)

.help-note
  opacity 0.8
  margin 4px 0

.help-table
  width 100%
  border-collapse collapse
  margin 6px 0
  th, td
    padding 3px 6px
    text-align left
    font-weight normal
    white-space nowrap
  th
    opacity 0.7
    border-bottom solid 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)
  kbd
    font-family inherit
    font-size 12px
    padding 1px 6px
    border solid 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)
    border-radius 3px
    background rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)
